Subject: [PATCH] InventoryChangeTrigger
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

该触发器在每次背包槽位同步（containerListener.slotChanged）时调用，
原实现无条件扫描全部槽位（每非空槽位含 getMaxStackSize 组件查找）统计
full/empty/occupied，而基类 SimpleCriterionTrigger.trigger 对空监听器集合本就无操作。
用 0086 引入的 hasListeners 早退，老玩家完成相关进度后为常态路径。
扫描为纯读操作无副作用，提前返回不改变任何可见行为。

diff --git a/net/minecraft/advancements/criterion/InventoryChangeTrigger.java b/net/minecraft/advancements/criterion/InventoryChangeTrigger.java
index 29d378939629549b5de1490cab5851c91864a04f..2b644e336beb56be069af2c30ccccaa890d10629 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/advancements/criterion/InventoryChangeTrigger.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/advancements/criterion/InventoryChangeTrigger.java
@@ -21,6 +21,13 @@ public class InventoryChangeTrigger extends SimpleCriterionTrigger<InventoryChan
     }
 
     public void trigger(ServerPlayer player, Inventory inventory, ItemStack stack) {
+        // Papo start - skip the full inventory scan when nobody listens; the base trigger
+        // no-ops on an absent/empty listener set, so the slot counts would be discarded.
+        // The scan is pure reads (getItem/isEmpty/getCount/getMaxStackSize), no side effects.
+        if (!this.hasListeners(player)) {
+            return;
+        }
+        // Papo end
         int i = 0;
         int i1 = 0;
         int i2 = 0;
